WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.720
Start in Cut Steward,

2
00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.480
the governed AI video studio.

3
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.135
Describe the outcome,

4
00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.795
then choose how closely you want to guide it.

5
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.190
Review rights before anything runs.

6
00:00:09.295 --> 00:00:10.575
Inspect every planned shot.

7
00:00:11.295 --> 00:00:14.350
Then open a separate verified delivery

8
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.505
to review the exact master,

9
00:00:15.995 --> 00:00:16.870
its full-decode check,

10
00:00:16.945 --> 00:00:17.925
SHA-256 hash,

11
00:00:18.005 --> 00:00:18.725
and approval evidence.

12
00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.095
One clear, local production record—

13
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.195
from first plan to final release truth.
